android: A4 — std::atomic<std::shared_ptr<T>> compat shim

NDK r27 libc++ provides no atomic<shared_ptr> specialization and the C++11
free-function API is deprecated in C++20 (warnings). Drop-in
gamescope::atomic_shared_ptr<T> (mutex-based, same member API) in new
src/Utils/AtomicSharedPtr.h, swapped in at the 5 compiled use sites.
(SDLBackend sites left untouched: backend disabled in our build.)

---
